   "$P(E \\mid F) + P(E \\mid \\bar{F}) = 1$",
   "$P(\\bar{E} \\mid F) + P(E \\mid \\bar{F}) = 1$",
   "$P(E \\mid \\bar{F}) + P(\\bar{E} \\mid \\bar{F}) = 0$"
  ],
  "solution": "$$P(E \\mid F) + P(\\bar{E} \\mid F) = \\frac{P(E \\cap F) + P(\\bar{E} \\cap F)}{P(F)} = \\frac{P((E \\cup \\bar{E}) \\cap F)}{P(F)} = \\frac{P(F)}{P(F)} = 1$$",
